  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid Term Review (MTR) to the Support to ICM in Lesotho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and the wider public with:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an overall independent assessment of the performance of the Support to the ICM in Lesotho&lt;em&gt;,&lt;/em&gt; paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve current and future interventions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
